# The packaged skills (prototype/skills/*.md + manifest.json) are
# SHA-256-pinned by byte content. Force LF on checkout so Windows clones
# (core.autocrlf=true) don't get CRLF bytes that would invalidate the
# manifest. SkillStore also normalizes CRLF before hashing as defense in
# depth, but the canonical on-disk form stays LF.
/prototype/skills/*.md text eol=lf
/prototype/skills/manifest.json text eol=lf
